{
  "id": "a-bonus-for-erin",
  "level": 2,
  "title": "A Bonus for Erin",
  "brief": "Dave is the regular vendor and gets USDC whenever he invoices. Erin just finished an audit and is owed a single USDC bonus. After that one payment, Erin is back to receiving nothing.",
  "setup": {
    "balances": {
      "USDC": "20000"
    },
    "rules": [
      {
        "target": "USDC",
        "selector": "transfer",
        "policy": "ERC20TransferPolicy",
        "config": {
          "recipients": [
            {
              "account": "Dave",
              "permission": "ALWAYS"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "allowedPolicies": [
    "ERC20TransferPolicy",
    "OneTimeAllowPolicy",
    "AllowPolicy"
  ],
  "parRules": 1,
  "testMode": "sequence",
  "tests": [
    {
      "label": "Pay Dave 1000 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "1000"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Erin's 2500 USDC bonus",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Erin",
            "2500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Dave another 1000 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Dave",
            "1000"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Erin 2500 USDC again",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Erin",
            "2500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    },
    {
      "label": "Pay Mallory 2500 USDC",
      "tx": {
        "to": "USDC",
        "call": {
          "fn": "transfer",
          "args": [
            "Mallory",
            "2500"
          ]
        }
      },
      "want": "block"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "There is one rule for USDC transfers, so Dave and Erin have to share it.",
    "The recipient allowlist gives each person a permission: ALWAYS or ONCE.",
    "Keep Dave on ALWAYS and add Erin with ONCE."
  ],
  "solution": [
    {
      "target": "USDC",
      "selector": "transfer",
      "policy": "ERC20TransferPolicy",
      "config": {
        "recipients": [
          {
            "account": "Dave",
            "permission": "ALWAYS"
          },
          {
            "account": "Erin",
            "permission": "ONCE"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "explain": "Dave and Erin share one key, transfer on USDC, so they share one policy. The allowlist keeps a permission per person, and ONCE is used up by the payment that uses it. A one-time pass would have been used up by the first USDC payment of any kind, so Dave would have been refused next."
}
